{"id":426,"title":"解答: 带乘法的嵌套循环（中等）","summary":"详细分析了问题中带乘法的嵌套循环的复杂度。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"62a8d41c-3e22-4a6b-8555-46f45fbea338","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"53c14e06-7716-41f6-b2e1-3faf5a39b54c","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n 可为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nfor var in range(1, n, 3):\n    j = 1\n    print(pie)\n    while j < n:  # 注意内循环变量j 之和n 有关\n        sum += 1\n        j *= 3\nprint(sum)  # O(1)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d0603fef-9072-41a0-800e-0799493e0b8e","text":"- 外循环变量`var`依次为: `1、4、7、10、... n` 总共循环次数= $\\frac{n}{3}$\n\n- 内循环变量`j`依次为: `1、3、9、27、... n` 总共循环次数= $log_3 n$\n\n\n| 语句   | 执行次数    |\n| --- | --- |\n|   n = 10 |   1  |\n|  sum = 0   |   1  |\n|  pie = 3.14   |   1  |\n|   for var in range(1,n,3):  |   $\\frac{n}{3}$  |\n|   print(pie);  |   $\\frac{n}{3}$  |\n|     while j < n:  |   $\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)$|\n|   sum+=1  |   $\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)$  |\n| j*=3| $\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)$|\n|   print(sum)  |   1  |\n\n### 复杂度\n\n**运行时间复杂度** \n\n$= 1+1+1+\\frac{n}{3}+\\frac{n}{3}+\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)+\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)+\\frac{n}{3}\\times\\log_3(n)+1$\n\n$= 4+ \\frac{2n}{3}+nlog_3(n)$\n\n现在，要找到Big(O)复杂度，\n1. 去掉常量 $\\Rightarrow n+nlog_3(n)$\n2. 删除低阶项 $\\Rightarrow nlog_3(n)$\n\n因此，Big O 时间复杂度：$O(nlog_3(n))$。",